<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109638" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόψυχρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>somewhat cold, coolish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.655
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>chilling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				62
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τὰς φύσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Tetr.</u>
					56
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>rather lacking in humour, flat,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωμικοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λύκις; προοίμιον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Anon.
				<u>in Tht.</u>
				3.30
			</span></i>; <i>rather absurd,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζήτημα ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Stat.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τὸ λέγειν ὡς</span> . .
				<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				83.22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμπτωσις φωνηέντων ὑπόψυχρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.163
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
